    <diag:sourceDocumentId rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DELL-EEM-2026</diag:sourceDocumentId>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">For each adapter assigned to a server, power is allocated when the server is turned on. If the available power is less than the required power, the Chassis Management Controller (CMC) will not power on the adapters associated with the server.</diag:explanation>
