    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Graphics Processing Unit (GPU) Baseboard has detected GPUs that are incorrectly located as identified in the message. The GPUs located in slots as identified in the message must be relocated.</diag:explanation>
