    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Refer to the HPE documentation for DIMM population guidelines and any warnings in regards to performance. It is recommended that you install supported configurations that allow optimum performance.</diag:itemText>
