    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: AMBIGUOUS_CORRESPONDENCE. An action exists, but its target cannot be tied to the documented cause by the conservative rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After Lifecycle Controller and CSIOR are enabled, restart the system and make sure that the inventory collection operation completes successfully.</diag:itemText>
