    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Click One-button secure erase. Important: Securely erasing the system might take up to a day or more to complete, depending on the storage size. Avoid interactions with iLO or the system that involves configuration changes and powering the system off, until the procedure is complete. For more information, see the Intelligent Provisioning User Guide for HPE ProLiant Gen10 Servers and HPE Synergy at http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
