    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault occurs when the transport VIF for a server is down. Cisco UCS Manager raises this fault when a fabric interconnect reports the connectivity state on virtual interface as one of the following: • Down • Errored • Unavailable</diag:explanation>
