    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Indicates that a RAID controller in Local Key Management (LKM) security mode has been detected on a server with iDRAC in Secure Enterprise Key Manager (SEKM) security mode. It is recommended to switch the PERC from LKM to SEKM mode.</diag:explanation>
