    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Monitor the error statistics on the degraded Persistent Memory DIMM through Cisco UCS Manager. If the high number of errors persists, there is a high possibility of the Persistent Memory DIMM becoming inoperable.</rdfs:comment>
