    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Server Configuration Profile for the import configuration operation is not compliant with schema nesting checks. Only RAID controllers can have nested Component nodes up to a maximum nesting depth of three.</diag:explanation>
