    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Copy the preserved data to the new NVDIMM. For more information, see the HPE 8GB NVDIMM User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
