    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The power supply unit identified in the message is offline, because of the one of the following reasons: 1) The power supply unit is not correctly seated. 2) The power cable may not be connected properly or disconnected. 3) The power supply unit has failed. 4) There is an input power failure.</diag:explanation>
