    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the failure persists, delete any namespaces on persistent regions of the PMEMs and retry. For more information, see the HPE Persistent Memory User Guide for HPE ProLiant Gen10 servers and HPE Synergy. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
