    <diag:sourcePage rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">388</diag:sourcePage>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NOTE: This fault is not currently implemented by UCSMThis fault is present only as a placeholder, possibly for another release,such as stand-alone rack servers.--- This fault occurs when signature validation of BIOS Flash Descriptor fails. Signature validation of BIOS occurs when server is A/C power on, pushed into a chassis or BIOS activation.</diag:explanation>
