    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enter a valid parameter and retry the operation. If the issue persists, contact your service provider. For information about valid parameters, see the OpenManage Enterprise-Modular Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
