    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [2, 366); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#ProcedureItem"/>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">1</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove and then reinstall the DIMM. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. See the DIMM handling guidelines at: https://h20565.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/ doc/public/display?sp4ts.oid=7271241&amp;docLocale=en_US&amp;docId=emr_na-c05161786.</diag:itemText>
