    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell CBL0006: CBL0006</rdfs:label>
    <diag:recommendsProcedure rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-CBL0006/procedure/01"/>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Each server model only supports a certain set of backplane configurations. For unified backplanes or split mode capable backplanes that are in unified mode, multiple controllers cannot be connected to the same backplane. In unified backplane situations any controller besides the first will not be operational.</diag:explanation>
