    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The system has detected a memory error which cannot be immediately corrected.The OS has been notified of the memory error location.Recommended action is to warm reboot the system to initiate auto-healing and to reinitialize memory for optimized performance.</diag:explanation>
