    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault typically occurs for one of the following reasons: • The fabric interconnect cannot communicate with a chassis. For a cluster configuration, this fault means that neither fabric interconnect can communicate with the chassis. • The chassis has an invalid FRU.</diag:explanation>
