    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install or upgrade the PSU firmware to get all the functionalities. For information about upgrading the
PSU firmware, see the iDRAC Users Guide of the respective iDRAC version on the support site.</diag:procedureText>
