    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Interlock_mon.c (vrd\src): { ICT_FAULT_KEY(ICT_MISCELLANEOUS, 2, 1), EVT_CRITICAL , EVT_CLASS_INTERLOCK, EVT_IL_DEV_INSTALLED_STATE }, Recommended Action: replace IOM. This is not a customer serviceable part, so if the 7-seg isn’t installed the IOM is not assembled correctly. The 7-segment display won’t work.</diag:itemText>
