    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Interlock_mon.c (vrd\src): { ICT_FAULT_KEY(ICT_MEZZ_CARD, 0, 0), EVT_INFORMATIONAL, EVT_CLASS_INTERLOCK, EVT_IL_DEV_INSTALLED_STATE }, Recommended Action: none – this is just informational.</diag:itemText>
