    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the RAID controller battery. For information about replacing the battery, see the hardware documentation of the respective RAID card.</rdfs:comment>
