    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The adaptor is missing. Cisco UCS Manager raises this fault when any of the following scenarios occur: • The endpoint reports there is no adapter in the adaptor slot. • The endpoint cannot detect or communicate with the adapter in the adaptor slot.</diag:explanation>
