    <diag:hasCategory rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/category/Accelerators%20and%20GPUs"/>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The health of Graphics Processing Unit (GPU) device identified in the message is degraded. There are a few memory pages retired on the device because of a Double Bit Error (DBE) or two consecutive Single Bit Errors (SBEs) on the memory cell. The memory pages are retired to avoid any runtime corruption of data.</diag:explanation>
