    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">HPE Synergy (http://www.hpe.com/info/synergy-troubleshooting) Determine if this error is expected due to a configuration change. If not, take appropriate steps to mitigate tampering with your system.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">3</diag:itemOrder>
