    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove the unsupported capacitor pack from the NVDIMM in Processor X, slot Y. For information specific to your server, see the server Maintenance and Service Guide at http:// www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs</rdfs:comment>
