    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Insert a SAS IOM device into the empty slot and retry the operation. For information about managing SAS IOM devices, refer to OpenManage Enterprise Modular Version Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
