    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check the CXL memory device and the native CPU memory configuration. Ensure that the devices comply with the configurations in the Installation and Service Manual for your model. Also check for other CXL or MEM event messages that may indicate hardware issues.</rdfs:comment>
