    <diag:vendor rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cisco</diag:vendor>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cisco UCS Manager raises this fault when the fabric interconnect exhaust all of the Optimizatino sets to be programmed in hardware. This fault does not indicate any problem in the configuration. However, some current or future configuration may cause some error and appropriate alert will be shown. Only when you see any other alters, there could be a cause of concern.</diag:explanation>
