    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0003 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1. Remove OCP from Slot1 and replace with a supported card.
2. Remove OCP from Slot2 and replace with a supported card.
3. Remove OCP from Slot3 and replace with a supported card.
4. Remove OCP from Slot4 and replace with a supported card.</diag:procedureText>
