  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SWC5012/procedure/01/item/002">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Proceed withcorrection:2a) Disconnect the power cords.2b) Use the information gathered above to locate the impacted cable or device.Else, if the message references an SL cable, locate the SL cable connector on the motherboard and trace the cable to the end device. Else, if the message references a critical cable, locate the specified cable path and associated components.2c)If the message references an SL cable,ensure that the device is firmly seated and, if it has any power, signal, and SL cables, ensure they are connected and firmly seated on both ends and there is no physical damage.If the message references a critical cable, ensure that the critical cable is connected and firmly seated on both ends and there is no physical damage.2d) Close the chassis cover and reconnect the power cords.2e) If the issue persists, collect a SupportAssist collection (TSR) report using iDRAC. Visithttps://www.dell.com/support/incidents-online/contactus/dynamicto use the Virtual Assistant to analyze the collection and recommend a resolution.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [999, 2039); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#ProcedureItem"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">2</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:investigatesCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SWC5012/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <diag:addressesCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SWC5012/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell SWC5012 printed item 2</rdfs:label>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2)</diag:sourceLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
