    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell HWC1104 printed item 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the peripheral sled identified in the message is supported by the chassis and the CMC/MM. For information about the supported sleds and firmware versions, see the System Manual available at the support site.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
