    <diag:sourcePage rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">260</diag:sourcePage>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault typically occurs for the following reasons: when Auto Firmware Sync Policy is set Auto-acknowledge or User-acknowledge and default host firmware pack is not available. • Auto Firmware Sync is not happening. • Default host firmware package is missing or deleted.</diag:explanation>
