    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Failed Array Controller: code:(lockup Code): Restart the server and run a diagnostic report. Install the latest version of controller firmware. If the condition persists, the controller may need to be replaced or require service.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
