    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The PCI Express end point failed to train or no device was detected on the bifurcated slot. Ensure the device
requires bifurcation and that the device is properly seated and running its latest firmware.</diag:causeText>
