    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The input voltage for Power Supply Unit (PSU) in the slot identified in the message is not detected. The power supply is installed correctly but an input source is not connected or is not functional.</diag:explanation>
