    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sanitize/Erase all NVDIMM-N on Processor 2 — Use this option when all the NVDIMM-Ns on a processor must be sanitized together, such as when enabling NVDIMM-N Memory Interleaving.</diag:itemText>
