    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Local disk [id] on server [chassisId]/[slotId] has thermal issue: [thermal]Local disk [id] on server [id] has thermal issue: [thermal]Local disk [id] on chassis [id] has thermal issue: [thermal]Local disk [id] on storage enclosure [id] has thermal issue: [thermal]</diag:messageText>
