    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [262, 559); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the physical disk is in an enclosure, check the thermostat settings and examine whether the enclosure is located near a heat source. Verify the enclosure has enough ventilation and that the room temperature is not too hot. Refer to the enclosure documentation for more diagnostic information.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3)</diag:sourceLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell PDR22 printed item 3</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
