    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the firmware prerequisite identified in the message is installed, and then retry updating the firmware. For information about prerequisite firmware, see the iDRAC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
