    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If &lt;Error Reason&gt; is (Battery missing or disconnected) then check the battery cable to the PERC controller. If &lt;Error Reason&gt; is (Replace battery pack) then replace battery pack. If &lt;Error Reason&gt; is (Remaining capacity low) then battery pack may need to be replaced soon.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
