    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify that the disk is healthy and that it has not been removed. Check the cables. See the Cables Attached Correctly section for more information on checking the cables. If necessary, replace the disk and reassign the dedicated hot spare.</diag:itemText>
