    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove the DIMM. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. See the Best Practices for Handling Memory Modules in ProLiant Server Configurations ( http://h20564.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na-c00868283).</rdfs:comment>
