    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [424, 458); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: AMBIGUOUS_CORRESPONDENCE. An action exists, but its target cannot be tied to the documented cause by the conservative rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">5.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reboot the system and try again.</diag:itemText>
