    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tape Drive Status Change. This trap indicates that the agent has detected a change in the status of a tape drive. The variable cpqDaTapeDrvStatus indicates the current tape status. The variable cpqDaTapeDrvScsiIdIndex indicates the SCSI ID of the tape drive.</diag:explanation>
