    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">External Array Spare Drive Status Change. This trap indicates that the agent has detected a change in the status of an External Channel Array spare drive. The variable cpqFcaSpareStatus indicates the current spare drive status. The variable cpqFcaSpareBusNumber indicates the SCSI bus number associated with this drive.</diag:explanation>
