    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Unable to upgrade the SmartFabric Storage Software firmware because the version of the uploaded image version is same as the existing the SmartFabric Storage Software.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
