    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One or more memory errors have occurred on memory slot identified in the message. The error occurred during Load Reduced DIMM (LR-DIMM) buffer initialization.</diag:explanation>
