    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reset NVRAM to default setting using the BIOS utility (F9). If the system does not boot, use System Maintenance Switch, SW6, to reset NVRAM. For more information, see the label on the server access panel or the Server User Guide.</diag:itemText>
