    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the sensor identified is a processor voltage sensor, remove the processor module and inspect processor socket, and replace if required. If the issue persists, contact your service provider.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
