    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The attribute identified in the message cannot be set, because the password is currently being reset by using plain text. The BIOS password cannot be simultaneously configured by using plain text and a hash.</diag:explanation>
