    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install replacement drives in the correct drive bay. Verify replacement drives are the correct drive type and capacity. Verify cable connections. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
