    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure the NIC devices are correctly installed in the system and retry the operation after the
Collect System Inventory On Restart (CSIOR) feature has updated the system inventory.</diag:procedureText>
