    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [542, 889); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0003 printed item 10</rdfs:label>
