    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">9</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If Enclosure Dynamic Power Capping or Enclosure Power Limit is enabled on supported servers, be sure there is sufficient power allocation to support the server. For additional information, see Power Issues in the Troubleshooting Guide for HPE ProLiant Gen10 servers. If this issue persists create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
