  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N96ea1bcd7edd42129ba52b994421ec91">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F2103/procedure/01"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check main and MCIO cables going to Riser in addition to AUX power going to PCIe slots and PCIe cards properly seated, maybe try power cycling, if not fix call TAC.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F2103/procedure/01/item/001"/>
