    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Be sure no loose connections exist. For more information, see "Resolving loose connections" in the Troubleshooting Guide.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [820, 944); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
