    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell DIAG0713 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BIOS error when reading the systems thermal sensor. Make sure the BIOS is current and rerun
diagnostics. If error persists, replace the motherboard.</diag:procedureText>
