    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure that all the CXL memory devices, BIOS, and iDRAC are updated to the latest firmware version.</rdfs:comment>
