    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: PMems must be installed on the black DIMM slot when on the same channel as a RDIMM/LRDIMM. Swap the DIMMs in Slots %1 and %2 on Processor %3. Review documentation for more information on supported configurations. 1. Remove all power.</rdfs:comment>
