    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault typically occurs because Cisco UCS Manager has detected an unsupported adapter unit extension, such as a pass-through adaptor. For example, the model, vendor, or revision is not recognized.</diag:causeText>
