  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-RDU0013">
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The current power operational mode is non-redundant because of a power supply exception, a power supply inventory change, or a system power inventory change. The system was previously operating in a power redundant mode.</diag:explanation>
