    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Extended Power Performance cannot be used unless chassis has six EPP capable PSUs, Configure the Power Redundancy Policy to Grid Redundancy &amp; MPCM, DPSE, SBPM and Fresh Air features should be disabled.</diag:explanation>
