    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The energy pack on the controller identified in the message cannot be detected because of following reasons:1) The controller cannot communicate with the energy pack.2) The energy pack is absent or improperly connected.3) The energy pack with a weak or depleted charge may also cause this message.The controller cache is not protected from power loss.</diag:explanation>
  </rdf:Description>
