    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the inlet temperature, fan health, or total power associated with the BOSS device is within specified limits. For information about specified values, see the iDRAC 9.0 and later Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 235); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:investigatesCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-HWC9001/procedure/01/cause"/>
  </rdf:Description>
