  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N51d3350dacfe40b3a2a223efa36e3d49">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove DIMMs or change the installed DIMM configuration from the affected channel. Consult the User Guide for more information on supported configurations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
