    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the PCIe disk wear status is ssdWearOut, replace the drive. For additional information, see your system Maintenance and Service Guide at http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</rdfs:comment>
