    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reassign spare drives using HPE SSA. This action is required only if there are inactive spare assignments. For more information, see the HPE Smart Storage Administrator User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
