  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N8fe3003a931a47dcae749056004e255f">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Install a maximum of Y NVDIMMs in the system. – System Halted! X = Number of NVDIMMs currently installed. Y= Maximum number of NVDIMMs supported. Reduce the number of NVDIMMs in the server to Y or fewer. For more information, see the server user guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-347/procedure/01/item/001"/>
