    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Persistent Memory (PM) configuration information of the NVDIMM in the memory slot arg1 is corrupted because the checksum or the header type is not valid.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
