    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0007 printed item 5</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reset the NVRAM to default using the BIOS utility (F9). If the system will not boot, then use System Maintenance Switch, SW6, to reset the NVRAM. For more information, see the label on the server access panel or the server user guide. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
