    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Memory%20module"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the Non-Volatile Dual In-line Memory Module (NVDIMM) device. For information about removing and reinstalling the NVDIMM, see the system Owners Manual on the support site.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
