    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The memory Built-In Self-test (BIST) has detected one or more errors on the DIMM installed on memory slot: arg1. As a result, the corresponding DIMM has been disabled.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
