    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Press the F1 key to continue disabling the drives until a new array configuration has been created. To avoid data loss, move the drives back to the original controller.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
