    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Acquire the correct firmware image file for the drive model identified in the message, and then retry the operation. The correct image file can be found by using the drive model information and searching the support site for related firmware.</diag:itemText>
