  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0023/procedure/01/item/004">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the access panels, and then attempt to restart the server. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [335, 456); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
