  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x31AD/procedure/01/cause">
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PCIe Enhanced Downstream Port signal has been triggered. A PCIe error has occurred. This can be caused
by hot-removal of NVMe storage devices or an uncorrectable PCIe error with an NVMe storage device.</diag:causeText>
