  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0453/procedure/01/item/003">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [454, 761); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
