    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 1175: Fibre Channel Tape Library Door Status Change.</rdfs:label>
    <diag:severity rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">WARNING</diag:severity>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fibre Channel Tape Library Door Status Change. This trap indicates that the agent has detected a change in the door status of a Fiber Channel Tape library. The variable cpqFcTapeLibraryDoorStatus indicates the current tape library door status. The variable cpqFcTapeLibraryScsiTarget indicates the SCSI ID of the tape library.</diag:explanation>
    <diag:recordId rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">HPE-GEN9-V2-Windows-cpqstmsg-dll-1175</diag:recordId>
