  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-RED152/procedure/01">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell RED152 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:considersCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-RED152/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Do the following:-1) Select the check box corresponding to the firmware to be updated, and then
click Install. The selected firmware is installed. If the list has both types of firmware update packages
then either DPU BMC or non-DPU BMC firmware is grayed out based on the type of firmware
first listed. For example, if a DPU BMC-based firmware is listed first in the Update Details section,
then subsequent non-DPU BMC based firmware will be grayed out and cannot be selected. 2) After
successfully updating the selected firmware, retry updating the firmware that was earlier grayed out.
3) Make sure there is no other Job already running if you are updating the DPU BMC firmware.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-RED152/procedure/01/item/001"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01">
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/005"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/003"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/001"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/006"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/004"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/item/002"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Processor"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Cooling%20device"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Power%20supply"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Check fans, processor heat sink, and air baffles installation.
1.  Verify that all air baffles and required blanks, such as drive blanks, processor heat sink blanks, power
supply blanks, and so on, are installed.
2.  Verify that the correct processor heat sink is installed.
3.  Verify that the correct fan is installed, if the system supports both standard fans and performance
fans.
For additional information, see the system documentation.
If this issue persists create an HPE Support Case.
1.  Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to
https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/home, and then click Warranty Status.
This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For
specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service
guide.
2.  Under Support Cases, click Access Cases, and then create a support case.
HPE Support will contact you.</diag:procedureText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0014 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:considersCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0002-0x0014/procedure/01/cause"/>
  </rdf:Description>
