  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0029-0x0002/procedure/01/item/008">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Interlock_mon.c (vrd\src): { ICT_FAULT_KEY(ICT_IO_PCIe_SLOTS, 1, 7), EVT_CRITICAL , EVT_CLASS_INTERLOCK, EVT_IL_DEV_INSTALLED_STATE }, Recommended Action: replace IOM. This is not a customer serviceable part, so if the cable isn’t installed the IOM is not assembled correctly. HBA Slot 2 won’t work</diag:itemText>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">8</diag:itemOrder>
