    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/home, and then click Warranty Check. This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service guide.</diag:itemText>
