  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-STOR0506/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exit Lifecycle Controller, press the &lt;F10&gt; key to re-enter Lifecycle Controller, and retry the operation.
If the problem persists, replace the physical disk or update the RAID controller firmware to the latest
version, and retry the operation.</diag:procedureText>
