    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">IOM [transport] interface [portId] on chassis [id] oper state: [operState], reason: [stateQual]Fabric Interconnect [transport] interface [portId] on fabric interconnect [id] oper state: [operState], reason: [stateQual]IOM [transport] interface [portId] on fex [id] oper state: [operState], reason: [stateQual]</diag:messageText>
