    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check the network connection between the iLO management port and the remote key manager. Ensure that the remote key manager configuration settings in iLO are properly configured. If the issue persists, update the iLO, SmartArray, and System ROM to the latest versions. Update firmware There are multiple ways to upgrade the firmware: HPE Support website:</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Management%20controller"/>
