    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The NVDIMM devices are placed in write-protect mode because the server may not provide sufficient power or the battery is not sufficiently charged to save data in case of power loss.</diag:causeText>
