    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Restart the system by using the iDRAC Virtual Power Cycle feature or perform a manual Power Cycle operation on the system. To perform a manual Power Cycle operation, do the following: a) Disconnect the power cords. b) Wait 30 seconds. c) Reconnect the power cords.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
