    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The link for a network-facing host interface is missing. Cisco UCS Manager raises this fault when it detects missing connectivity between a previously configured switch port and its previous peer host interface.</diag:explanation>
