    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Be sure no loose connections exist. For more information, see "Resolving loose connections" in the HPE ProLiant Gen9 Troubleshooting Guide, Volume 1.</diag:itemText>
