    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Physical Drive Status Change. This trap indicates that the agent has detected a change in the status of a drive array physical drive. The variable cpaDaPhyDrvStatus indicates the current physical drive status.</diag:explanation>
