    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Upgrade enclosure firmware. Link Errors: Reseat or replace I/O modules and cables. Check Fans, processor heat sink, and air baffles installation.</rdfs:comment>
