    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-PWR2268"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-PWR2268/procedure/01"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">population-assessment-1.0; automatic source-anchored rule assessment, not expert validation. Shared concepts: Power supply, catalog, voltage. The target retains the complete documented possible-cause block; alternatives are not asserted as confirmed causes.</rdfs:comment>
