    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Import the file by using the BIOS System Setup page by pressing F2 when the company logo is displayed while booting the server. For information about the maximum file size allowed, see the iDRAC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
