    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Go to System Setup &gt; System Security page, click the "Clear" option under TPM command. Restart the system. For TPM 1.2, go to System Setup &gt; System Security page, click the "Activate" option under TPM command, and then enable TXT.</diag:itemText>
