    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BIOS cannot initialize the server to interleave CPU system memory and CXL memory together because the server hardware is incorrectly configured, or the CXL hardware or CPU system memory has issues.</diag:explanation>
