    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Enclosed Rear Door Heat Exchanger (eRDHx) fans are running in test mode while eRDHx thermal controls are powered off. The eRDHx is not providing cooling to the rack in test mode. The test mode continues until it is disabled or thermal controls are powered on.</diag:explanation>
