    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#ProcedureItem"/>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Power cycle the system to make the updated version of Microcontroller Unit (MCU) firmware effective.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 100); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
