    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Change the NIC mode to dedicated mode by using "racadm set idrac.nic.selection &lt;1 | Dedicated&gt;", and retry the operation.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
