    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reboot the server. The server will reboot multiple times as part of the sanitize process. POST messages will also display to indicate the NVDIMM-Ns that are being sanitized. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
