    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the storage controller is on a removable board, locate and reseat the indicated storage controller option. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website:</diag:itemText>
