    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">2</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the fault reports a "Thermal Sensor threshold crossing in blade" error for one or more blade servers, check if DIMM or processor temperature related faults have been raised against that blade.</diag:itemText>
