    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [53, 322); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Review the fault and the error message on the FSM tab for the endpoint to determine why the firmware image is unusable. The error message usually includes an explanation for why the endpoint could not boot from the startup image, such as Bad-Image or Checksum Failed.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-PSU8521/procedure/01/cause">
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The power supply unit (PSU) identified in the message was turned off because the temperature exceeded the high temperature threshold in the unit.</diag:causeText>
