  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SEKM026">
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The KMS CA Certificate will expire in few days as identified in the message. If an updated certificate is not uploaded to iDRAC then the SEKM functionality will not be available and key exchange with storage controller could fail leading to data lockout.</diag:explanation>
