    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Add an RDIMM/LRDIMM to the indicated processor according to the memory population guidelines. Review documentation for more information on supported configurations. For DIMM population, see the Population rules for HPE DDR4 memory with HPE ProLiant and Synergy Gen10 servers (http://www.hpe.com/docs/memory-population-rules)</diag:itemText>
