    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gather a SupportAssist collection (TSR) using iDRAC. Visit www.dell.com/support to use the Virtual
Assistant to analyze the collection and recommend a resolution.</diag:procedureText>
