    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the DIMM. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. See the Best Practices for Handling Memory Modules in ProLiant Server Configurations (http://h20564.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na- c00868283).</diag:itemText>
