    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check if the server has power, physical disks are available, and physical disks are connected to the enclosure or backplane.</rdfs:comment>
