    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify that all PSUs are correctly seated, functioning properly, and connected to a stable AC power source. Replace any faulty power supplies, and ensure the total PSU capacity is sufficient to load hardware components installed in the server.</diag:itemText>
