    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [455, 677); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: AMBIGUOUS_CORRESPONDENCE. An action exists, but its target cannot be tied to the documented cause by the conservative rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">4</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ensure the Collect System Inventory on Reboot (CSIOR) feature is enabled. Restart the host device and allow inventory collection to complete. For more information, see the iDRAC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
