    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Expansion of storage capacity of a Virtual Disk is limited by the disk space of its physical disks and the Virtual Disk RAID level. Based on these two values there is a maximum limit on the capacity expansion size of a Virtual Disk.</diag:explanation>
