    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify the fan airflow path is not blocked by cables or other material. For additional information, see the Troubleshooting Guide for HPE ProLiant Gen10 servers. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
