    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cisco F2132 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If you see this fault, take the following actions:
1. Application faults for the adapter will be suppressed if the adapter does not boot
