    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: To enable this NVDIMM, either install previously used processor if processor has been changed recently, or NVDIMM needs to be sanitized to configure it with the newly installed processor type.</rdfs:comment>
