    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">It is recommended that operator should delete the extra Virtual Interfaces(VIF) than are there in the FI. System may appear to be normally functioning even with these extra VIFs in place. However there may be performance issues observed as the system is operating above the recommended scale limits..</diag:itemText>
