    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The heatsinks are critical for providing cooling to the PCIe switches. If a PCIe switch stops functioning due to improper cooling, the PCIe subsystem may no longer function correctly and data loss may occur.</diag:explanation>
