    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Install a Smart Storage battery with capacity to support all installed battery-back devices, such as array controllers or NVDIMMs. See the server maintenance and server guide for your system at http:// www.hpe.com/assistance. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</rdfs:comment>
