    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Review the Integrated Management Log for another event that might indicate which memory module has failed.</rdfs:comment>
