    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the compatible firmware image file is uploaded and retry the operation. For information about the compatible hardware to be used with CMC version, see the Chassis Management Controller Users Guide available at the support site.</diag:itemText>
