  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-PDR104/procedure/01/item/001">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Support escalation or collection instructions are not treated as a repair of the cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 162); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Gather a SupportAssist collection (TSR) using iDRAC. Visit www.dell.com/support to use the Virtual Assistant to analyze the collection and recommend a resolution.</diag:itemText>
