    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The status of the power cord cannot be determined because of one of the following reasons: 1) The power cable may not be connected properly or disconnected. 2) The power cord sensor in the power supply unit has failed. However, the power supply unit may still function. 3) There is an input power failure.</diag:explanation>
    <diag:hasMessageTemplate rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SYS116/message/01"/>
    <diag:sourceDocumentId rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DELL-EEM-2026</diag:sourceDocumentId>
