    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Retry the operation. If the issue persists, do the following and retry the operation: 1) Power OFF the
chassis. 2) Make sure that the chassis has properly working PSUs. 3) Make sure that the PSUs have
input power.</diag:procedureText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell PSU8525 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
