    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Plug in the internal cable correctly.
Install and route in the internal LED board cable correctly. For more information, see the server user guide
on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
