  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N543f34f29c284cfa89d79bf057aaf18e">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Power down and remove all power from the server. Remove the system battery for 10 minutes. Reinstall the battery and power on the server. To locate the system battery and for server-specific procedures, see the product documentation.</rdfs:comment>
