    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The enclosure is too hot. A variety of factors can cause the excessive temperature. For example, a fan may have failed, the thermostat may be set too high, or the room temperature may be too hot.</diag:explanation>
