    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Update the iDRAC, BIOS, and PCIe device firmware to the latest available version.</rdfs:comment>
