    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To enable this NVDIMM, either Channel Interleaving need to be set as Disabled or all NVDIMMs on identified processor must be sanitized to work with present system configuration. If manual data backup of NVDIMM is desired, set system configuration as Channel Interleaving disabled to match with NVDIMM configuration and take NVDIMM data backup. Chose desired system configuration afterwards. Enabling or disabling Channel Interleaving</diag:itemText>
