    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Be sure the system has enough power, particularly if you recently added hardware, such as drives. Remove the newly added component and if the issue is no longer present, then additional power supplies are required. Check the system information from the IML.</diag:itemText>
