    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Ensure that the server operating environment such as fans and heatsinks are normally functioning. For information about these server components, see the Installation and Service Manual (ISM) of the respective server model available on the support site.</rdfs:comment>
