    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ensure that the following is correct: 1) Input power source is connected to the PSU. 2) Power is
