    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the degraded physical disk. Identify the disk that is degraded by locating the disk that has a red "X" for its status. Perform a rescan after replacing the disk.</diag:itemText>
