    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Ensure that the energy pack is installed and properly connected to the controller. For information about cabling, see the respective PERC Users Guide or the Installation and Service Manual (ISM) of the respective server platform on the support site.</rdfs:comment>
