    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.Ensure if board bring up is done correctly 2.AC power cycle the system 3.Ensure that all relevant firmware and software are up-to-date 4.Contact HPE service customer care.</diag:itemText>
