    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1745- Slot X Drive Array - Drive Erase Operation Completed. The following disk drive(s) have been erased and will remain offline until hot-replaced or re-enabled by the Array Configuration Utility: (Followed by a list of drives)</diag:messageText>
