    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the error persists, replace the NVDIMM. For removal and replacement procedures, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
