    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Verify that the air flows on the Cisco UCS chassis or rack server are not obstructed.</rdfs:comment>
