    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1826-Slot X Encryption Failure-Encryption engine hardware failure. Encrypted logical drives offline. Encrypted logical drives are offline until the problem is corrected. Action: Replace the controller to bring encrypted drives online.</diag:messageText>
