    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Quick Path Interconnect failed during system POST. Reboot the system. If problem persists, remove input power and reseat processors. This exception occurred early in system power on, thus the system may not display video.</diag:explanation>
