    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x3119/procedure/01/item/001"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x3119/procedure/01/item/006"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x3119/procedure/01/item/007"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Memory%20module"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x3119 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.  Back up any data stored on the Persistent Memory Module to other media .
For more information, see the HPE Scalable Persistent Memory User Guide on the Hewlett Packard
Enterprise website (HPE Scalable Persistent Memory docs).
2.  Create an HPE support case.
a.  Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to the:
Customer Self Repair website.
This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed.
For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance
and service guide.
b.  Create a support case at: http://www.hpe.com/support/hpesc.
HPE Support will contact you.
3.  Replace the Persistent Memory Module.
1.  Remove all power.
a.  Disconnect each power cord from the power source.
b.  Disconnect each power cord from the server
2.  Remove the Persistent Memory Module.
CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the
system board connector. See the DIMM handling guidelines on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise
Library at: http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs
3.  Install the new Persistent Memory Module.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:considersCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x3119/procedure/01/cause"/>
  </rdf:Description>
