    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [53, 188); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Check the temperature readings for the blade servers and IOM and ensure they are within the recommended thermal safe operating range.</diag:itemText>
