    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Chassis Management Controller is not able to communicate with the iDRAC on the server identified in the message. Therefore, the server could not be power cycled. This situation may occur when iDRAC is rebooting.</diag:explanation>
