    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#ProcedureItem"/>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Consult the Integrated Management Log (IML) for additional information. If the issue persists, confirm the system firmware are latest, including the System Programmable Logic Device and system ROM. Check the PMem module and replace it if needed.</diag:itemText>
