    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 144); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If you see this fault, consider upgrading the CIMC firmware, and the entire Cisco UCS instance if necessary, to Cisco UCS, Release 1.4 or later.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cisco F0741 printed item 1</rdfs:label>
