  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Cache-module-The-cache-for-this-controller-is-temporarily-disabled-since-a-snapshot-is-in-prog-5387f3ab3b/procedure/01">
