    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reset the controller to enable the cache.
Cache module operations such as Expansion, Extension, and Migration are disabled until the reboot
completes.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
