    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Storage system fan status change. The agent has detected a change in the fan module status of a storage system. The variable cpqSsFanModuleStatus indicates the current fan status.</diag:explanation>
