    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure device such as Self Encrypting Drive (SED) is not in a lockedor foreign state. If yes , unlock
the device then the device before updatingthe firmware.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N7a5dd8ab62e644a8b8cbbf589ba623d6">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Attempt to download the enclosure firmware again. If problems continue, verify that the controller can communicate with the enclosure. Make sure that the enclosure is powered ON. Refer to the storage hardware documentation for information on checking the cables.</rdfs:comment>
