    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Refer to the platform documentation for details related to SDPM subsystem. Copy any data in the persistent memory to another persistent device such as a hard drive. Power off the system and remove input power. Inspect and re-insert all the SDPM power and data cables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Storage%20drive"/>
