    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0029-0x0002"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Interlock_mon.c (vrd\src): { ICT_FAULT_KEY(ICT_IO_PCIe_SLOTS, 0, 7), EVT_CRITICAL , EVT_CLASS_INTERLOCK, EVT_IL_DEV_INSTALLED_STATE }, Recommended Action: replace IOM. This is not a customer serviceable part, so if the cable isn’t installed the IOM is not assembled correctly. HBA Slot 1 won’t work</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Interconnect%20module"/>
