  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-PSU8530/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1) Check the Power Supply Unit (PSU)input power source. 2) Press and hold the power button for 30
seconds. The PSU is powered on. 3) If the issue persists, contact technical support.</diag:procedureText>
