    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">300-IMPORTANT: Unable to log an entry to the Integrated Management Log (IML). Action: Remove power. If issue persists, update iLO FW. If issue still persists, call HP service.</diag:messageText>
