    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">6</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Be sure no ventilation issues exist. If the server is operated for an extended period of time with the access panel removed, airflow might be impeded, causing thermal damage to components. For further requirements, see the server documentation.</diag:itemText>
