  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-SWC8619">
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Chassis Management Controller (CMC) is unable to process inventory data from the server in the slot identified in the message. This can happen if: 1) There is a communications issue between the CMC and the iDRAC on the server identified in the message. 2) Incorrect firmware is installed on network cards. 3) Incorrect firmware is installed on the server iDRAC. 4) There is no free temporary storage in the CMC.</diag:explanation>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#EventDefinition"/>
