    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install the processors sequentially starting with Processor 1.
For more information, see the server user guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise
website:
•  HPE ProLiant Gen10 (https://www.hpe.com/info/proliantgen10-docs)
•  HPE Synergy (https://www.hpe.com/info/synergy-docs)</diag:procedureText>
