    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure there is enough power supply to distribute power. Using the CMC Web UI, go to Chassis Overview &gt; Power &gt; Power Budget Status. In the Total Input Power Available For Allocation field view the available power. To add more power, insert more PSUs or remove unused components from the chassis.</diag:itemText>
