    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the Virtual Disk size specified for the reconfiguration operation is less than or equal to the maximum possible value. For information about the maximum possible value, see the Lifecycle Controller Users Guide available at the support site.</diag:itemText>
