    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Turn off the server and replace the NVDIMMs to make sure all NVDIMM SKUs or controller revisions
are same. For more information about the NVDIMMs SKUs or controller revision, see the product
Installation and Service Manual available on the support site.</diag:procedureText>
