  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-347/procedure/01/item/001">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install a maximum of Y NVDIMMs in the system. – System Halted! X = Number of NVDIMMs currently installed. Y= Maximum number of NVDIMMs supported. Reduce the number of NVDIMMs in the server to Y or fewer. For more information, see the server user guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
