    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify that the network port is enabled and if the port has Activity/Speed LEDs, that they are lit. Check the network cable, network cable connections, and the attached network switch.</diag:itemText>
