  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F0626/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If you see this fault, take the following actions:
1. Check whether the host Ethernet interface is connected to a port belonging to its peer fabric interconnect.
2. If connectivity seems correct, reacknowledge the server.
3. If the above actions did not resolve the issue, create a show tech-support file and contact Cisco TAC.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F0626/procedure/01/item/002"/>
