    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Verify the health status of the energy pack. Refer to iDRAC Service Module (ISM) for guidance.</rdfs:comment>
