    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cisco F1396 printed item 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">It is recommended that operator should delete the extra secondary vlans that are there in the FI. System may appear to be normally functioning even with these extra secondary vlans in place. However there may be performance issues observed as the system is operating above the recommended scale limits..</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
