    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Reseat the processor WARNING: To reduce the risk of personal injury from hot surfaces, allow the drives and the internal system components to cool before touching them. CAUTION: THE PINS ON THE SYSTEM BOARD ARE VERY FRAGILE AND EASILY DAMAGED. To avoid damage to the system board, do not touch the processor or the processor socket contacts. IMPORTANT: Both processor sockets must always be populated. If either processor socket is empty, the server does not power up. Reseat the memory</diag:itemText>
