    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1)Verify network connectivity between the appliance and the configured update source.2.If a proxy is configured, validate proxy settings and ensure the update source URL is reachable through it.3.Check available disk space on the appliance and free up storage if necessary.4.Review the console-update- manager-service logs for the specific failure reason.5.Retry the Console Update Task.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
