    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [131, 422); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0461 printed item 4</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the DIMM. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. See the Best Practices for Handling Memory Modules in ProLiant Server Configurations (http://h20564.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na-c00868283).</diag:itemText>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">4</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:addressesCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x0461/procedure/01/cause"/>
  </rdf:Description>
