    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0002 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.  Verify that there is sufficient power provisioned
2.  Verify that the capping configuration is appropriate for the existing workload. Consider increasing the
power cap or adding power capacity if necessary to prevent the reduced performance
For information on configuring power capacity, see the iLO documentation at http://www.hpe.com/support/
ilo-docs.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
