    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An unknown module has been labeled with a FAILED status. This status is usually indicated by the OA after a module hot-plug insert operation or when VCM is starting up. This condition is usually fatal. Possible cause: A hardware failure or corrupted firmware.</diag:explanation>
