    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If Lifecycle Controller / Unified Server Configurator (USC) is in use, wait until it has exited and retry the action. Otherwise retry after 30 seconds to check if network connectivity caused this error.</diag:itemText>
