  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nad5b173918a846589ad333de906f6cee">
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-1775/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">population-assessment-1.0; automatic source-anchored rule assessment, not expert validation. Shared concepts: Cable or connector. The target retains the complete documented possible-cause block; alternatives are not asserted as confirmed causes.</rdfs:comment>
