    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the temperature status is degraded or failed, shut down the storage system as soon as possible. Be sure that the storage system environment is being cooled properly and that no components are overheated.</diag:itemText>
