    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure the system operates within the subsystem Connector Limit for the components specified. To review power budget information select Chassis Overview -&gt; Power -&gt; Budget Status. Turn off unused components within the subsystem to make power available for the server to turn on or turn off low priority servers and try the operation again.</diag:itemText>
