    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Power off the server and ensure that the sensor cable is properly connected to the zone identified in the message. If the issue persists then provide this iDRAC Lifecycle log to the Technical Support team.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-HTR0030"/>
