    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The operation cannot be started because iDRAC Service Module (iSM) running on the server operating system (OS) is not compatible with iDRAC firmware version installed on the server.</diag:explanation>
