    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the SSD immediately. For more information, see the maintenance and service guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 148); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
