  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0348 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:considersCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/007"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/006"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/003"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/004"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/005"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/002"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0348/procedure/01/item/001"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the unsupported DIMM.
1.  Remove all power.
a.  Disconnect each power cord from the power source.
b.  Disconnect each power cord from the server
2.  Remove the DIMM.
CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system
board connector. Go to the Population rules for HPE DDR4 memory with HPE ProLiant and Synergy
Gen10 servers (http://www.hpe.com/docs/memory-population-rules) for DIMM population rules and
guidelines.
For more information on supported DIMMs for HPE Synergy products, see the HPE Synergy documentation
on the HPE Enterprise Information Library website.
For more information on supported DIMMs for HPE Apollo and HPE ProLiant products, see the HPE
Enterprise Information Library.
If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.
1.  Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to the:
Customer Self Repair website.
This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For
specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service
guide.
2.  Create a support case at: http://www.hpe.com/support/hpesc.
HPE Support will contact you.</diag:procedureText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Memory%20module"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1922/procedure/01/item/005">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/home, and then click Check Status under the Warranty Check heading. This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service guide.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [1471, 1848); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#ProcedureItem"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">5</diag:itemOrder>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x1922 printed item 5</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
