    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the issue persists, update the iLO, Smart Array, and System ROM to the latest versions. For more information, see the following topic in the troubleshooting guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website:</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
