    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the Firmware Verification tab is enabled, select Log and Repair Automatically in the Scan Settings option of the Firmware Verification tab and reinitiate the scan. The iLO User Guide contains additional information in the topic - Server Platform Services (SPS) Descriptor Check and Recovery. Loading iLO Advanced License and enabling Log and Repair Automatically configures the server for Auto recovery.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
