    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the cooling fan is missing, install a compatible cooling fan. For information about supported cooling fan specification and procedure to install the cooling fan, see the Installation and Service Manual (ISM) of the respective PowerEdge server available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
