    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Review event log for fan failures. Maximum supported ambient temperature varies by configuration. Check system operating environment by assessing neighboring sleds and chassis inlet temperatures and site conditions for significant variations from chassis temperature. Verify that iDRAC and MM firmware are up-to-date.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
  </rdf:Description>
