    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [239, 342); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cisco F0203 printed item 3</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the above actions did not resolve the issue, create a show tech-support file and contact Cisco TAC.</diag:itemText>
