    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the riser board with a supported option. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2.</diag:sourceLabel>
