    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The operation cannot be started because the operation is not supported on the NVMe RAID drives. Either the drive is behind hardware RAID controller or the RAIDMode may not match the RAIDType or the SoftwareRAIDMode requested.</diag:explanation>
