  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x3161/procedure/01/item/001">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify that C-states are disabled in the System ROM and under the operating system. For Linux, the Intel C-state driver must be disabled by adding "intel_idle.max_cstate : 0" to the kernel command line parameter.</diag:itemText>
