    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the fault reports a "No connectivity between IOM and blade" or "Thermal Sensor readings unavailable from blade" error, check if that blade server is operational and whether any faults have been raised against that blade server. In this situation, the chassis controller may go into a fail-safe operating mode and the fan speeds may increase as a precautionary measure.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: NO_DOCUMENTED_CAUSE. No documented cause in this source solution group; do not invent a cause.</rdfs:comment>
