    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0234"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the issue persists, reseat the processors. CAUTION: Before removing or replacing any processors, be sure to follow the processor troubleshooting guidelines in "Performing Processor Procedures in the Troubleshooting Process" in the HPE ProLiant Troubleshooting Guide, Volume I: Troubleshooting. Failure to follow the recommended guidelines can cause damage to the system board, requiring replacement of the system board.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
