    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Server could not power on at this time. Enclosure Controller is trying to switch to optimized boot mode. Make sure all other sleds are fully booted to operating system and try again to power up.</diag:itemText>
