    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sanitize all NVDIMMs on Processor X. For more information, see the HPE 16GB NVDIMM User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website (https://www.hpe.com/info/NVDIMM-docs).</diag:itemText>
