    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Press the F2 key to use the drives as configured and lose all the data on them. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website:</diag:itemText>
