    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">•  The keyboard is not connected correctly.
•  The keyboard has failed.
•  The mouse is not connected correctly.
•  The mouse has failed.
•  An issue exists with the system board.</diag:causeText>
