  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1934/procedure/01">
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/System%20board"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Battery%20or%20capacitor"/>
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Cable%20or%20connector"/>
    <diag:considersCause rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1934/procedure/01/cause"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x1934 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.  Install a supported energy pack.
In servers that support installing more than one energy pack, verify that the energy pack is connected
to the correct connector on the system board.
For more information, see the server user guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise
website:
◦ HPE ProLiant Gen10 (http://www.hpe.com/info/proliantgen10-docs)
◦ HPE Synergy (http://www.hpe.com/info/synergy-docs)
2.  Power down server and verify that the energy pack cable is well-seated.
3.  Match the energy pack to the number of loads.
For more information, see the QuickSpecs on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website (http://www.hpe.com/
info/qs).
If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.
1.  Verify the component is either under warranty or contract. Go to
https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/home, and then click Check Status under the Warranty Check
heading.
This enables HPE to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For
specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service
guide.
2.  Under Support Cases, click Access Cases, and then create a support case.
HPE Support will contact you.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1934/procedure/01/item/002"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1934/procedure/01/item/005"/>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x1934/procedure/01/item/006"/>
