    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the SSD is in wearout state, then replace the drive. For additional information, go to the Information Library (http://www.hpe.com/info/Gen10-troubleshooting). Create an HPE Support Case.</rdfs:comment>
