    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If this fault is seen in conjunction with fltBiosUnitFD0FailedSecurityVerification, please re-attempt BIOS update and activation. Then, reboot the CIMC. Otherwise, please contact Cisco TAC.</diag:itemText>
