  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0013-0x0017/procedure/01/cause">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#PossibleCause"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0017 possible cause 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If Status is Temporarily Disabled
The energy pack is charging.
If Status is Disabled
•  The energy pack is missing.
•  The energy pack cable or controller backup power cable is not well seated.
•  The energy pack has failed.
•  The energy pack load capacity is not sufficient.</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
