    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To change the Management Port mode settings do the following: If a device is present, remove and reinsert the USB device from the front panel USB Management port and retry the operation. If the issue persists restart the iDRAC and retry the operation.</diag:itemText>
