    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">245-Processor Power-on Issue: Processor X did not power up. Action: Confirm installed processors are the same model. If so, power cycle. If not resolved, reseat or swap processors. If the issue persists, contact HP service.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
