    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Update iLO firmware to a version supporting encryption.
For more information, see the HPE iLO 4 User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
