  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000B-0x0015/procedure/01">
    <diag:targetsComponentType rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Power%20supply"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If running a redundant configuration, be sure that all of the power supplies in the system have the same
spare part number and are supported by the server.
•  For a list of supported power supplies, see the server documentation.
•  You can disable these messages by turning off the Mismatch Power Supply Reporting in the system
BIOS settings.</diag:procedureText>
