    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault typically occurs when an updated group cap is insufficient to meet the minimum hardware requirements and a chassis that has just been added to the power group cannot be capped as a result.</diag:explanation>
