    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Wait until the existing firmware update jobs are completed or scheduled before retrying the operation. To monitor the status of the existing jobs, use the "racadm jobqueue view" command.</diag:itemText>
