    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-1611/procedure/01"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure that all required fans are installed correctly and spinning. For more information, see "Fan issues" in the HPE ProLiant Gen9 Troubleshooting Guide, Volume I on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</rdfs:comment>
