    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The requested job cannot be run because another job is currently running. Two options for running jobs on multiple storage controllers are: 1) Run the jobs on each controller individually. Wait for each job to complete before starting the configuration and job creation on the next controller. 2) Schedule multiple jobs to run at a later time using the scheduling options.</diag:explanation>
