    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1712-Slot X Drive Array – RAID 5 volume(s) present with 56 drives or more, but cache size &lt;= 32MB. This configuration is not recommended. Consider configuring volume(s) to RAID 0 or 1, reducing the number of drives, or upgrading the Array Accelerator module.</diag:messageText>
