    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">On the OpenManage Enterprise - Modular, select ForceActive (Devices-&gt; I/O Modules-&gt; Overview-&gt; More Actions) to override the mismatch. The local configuration on the selected IOM will be applied to both the SAS IOMs.</diag:itemText>
