    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Run the following RACADM command at the Command Line Interface (CLI) and retry the operation: racadm racreset. For more information about RACADM commands of iDRAC, see the latest version of "iDRAC with Lifecycle Controller RACADM CLI Guide" available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
