    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure the system operates within the subsystem Connector Limit for the components specified. To review power budget information select Chassis Overview -&gt; Power -&gt; Budget Status. Turn off unused components within the subsystem to make power available for the server to turn on or turn off low priority servers and try the operation again.</rdfs:comment>
