    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [364, 556); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: AMBIGUOUS_CORRESPONDENCE. An action exists, but its target cannot be tied to the documented cause by the conservative rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 1703 printed item 4</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the issue persists, replace the cache module or controller. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide for your product on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website:</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-UEFI0076/procedure/01">
