    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Check the System Event Log (SEL) to identify the Corrected Machine Check (CMC) errors. Resolve
the issue identified in the SEL that caused the CMC.</diag:procedureText>
