    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install the DIMMs and processors in a supported configuration. For more information, see the memory population rules on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website (https://www.hpe.com/docs/memory-population-rules). For additional information, see the server user guide for your product:</diag:itemText>
