    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [179, 233); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: CONTEXT_OR_REFERENCE. No recognised diagnostic/corrective instruction in this printed item.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Locate and correctly place the indicated OCP device.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">5</diag:itemOrder>
