    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure that the I/O Module belongs to a fabric mode by creating a fabric between the I/O Modules and retry the operation.</rdfs:comment>
