www.dell.com/support/incidents-online/contactus/dynamic to use the Virtual Assistant to analyze
the collection and recommend a resolution.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-VDR7/procedure/01/item/001"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell VDR7 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
