    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If you see this fault:
1. Kernel LowFree memory dropped below the minimal watermark of 100 MB. Please collect tech-support
info and contact Cisco Customer Support (TAC).
2. Also can log the memory footprint of the FI via "show system internal kernel meminfo"</diag:procedureText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cisco F1701 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
