    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A Clear task was being performed on a physical disk but the task was interrupted and did not complete successfully. The controller may have lost communication with the disk, the disk was removed, or the cables may be loose or defective.</diag:explanation>
