    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When a TPM is installed, be sure that the TPM is configured for a mode that is compatible with the OS running on the server. Verify that the OS supports the version of TPM installed and configured on the server.</diag:itemText>
