  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Windows-cpqstmsg-dll-1149">
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">External Array Accelerator Board Bad Data. This trap indicates that the agent has detected an Array Accelerator Cache Board that has lost battery power. If data was being stored in the accelerator memory when the system lost power, that data has been lost.</diag:explanation>
