    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell RDHX0012: RDHX0012</rdfs:label>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The eRDHx thermal controls are in the Mode indicated in the message. eRDHx fans are not running, liquid cooling valve is closed, effectively eRDHx is no longer cooling the rack.</diag:explanation>
