    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The management processor is unable to communicate with the Remote Key License Server due to a network
or configuration issue. SmartArray Drive Encryption cannot get the authentication keys to decrypt the
drives.</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
