    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">HPE Persistent Memory Percentage Remaining Alert. Processor %1 DIMM %2 ( SN: %3 ). The Persistent Memory Module has %4 percent or less specified life remaining. Future errors on this PMM may result in loss of data.</diag:messageText>
