    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To complete the controller key change operation, perform a power cycle by running the following
RACADM command at the Command Line Interface (CLI): "racadm serveraction powercycle".</diag:procedureText>
