    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the prerequisite firmware updates are installed, and then retry updating the firmware. For information about prerequisite firmware, see the iDRAC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
