    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: CONTEXT_OR_REFERENCE. No recognised diagnostic/corrective instruction in this printed item.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [319, 570); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To confirm the energy pack status in the iLO GUI, click System Information in the iLO navigation tree. For additional information, see the iLO User Guide at http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs. If this issue persists create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
