    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Controller State: The array controller contains a volume that was created with a different version of controller firmware and is not backward-compatible with the current version of firmware. You may reconfigure the controller, but the existing configuration and data will be overwritten and potentially lost.</diag:messageText>
