    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify there is sufficient power provisioned or the capping configuration is sufficient for the existing workload. Consider increasing the power cap or adding power capacity if necessary to prevent the reduced performance. For all HPE ProLiant Gen10 servers, see the HPE Power Advisor on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website (http://www.hpe.com/info/poweradvisor). If this issue persists create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: AMBIGUOUS_CORRESPONDENCE. An action exists, but its target cannot be tied to the documented cause by the conservative rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 418); ACTIONABLE_SOURCE_PREFIX; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0003 printed item 1</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
