    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The operational status of the I/O Module identified in the message has ended. Possible reasons could be that the MCM Group maintenance is in progress or Management Module maintenance is in progress or Fabric maintenance is in progress or Node maintenance is in progress.</diag:causeText>
