  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nffe2e1a7b31243bdbfc5a33644b1ed1c">
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the Coin Cell battery. For more information about replacing, see the Management Module Users Guide available on the support site.</rdfs:comment>
