    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">•  The energy pack has been removed.
•  The energy pack cable connector needs to be reseated.
•  The energy pack is faulty.</diag:causeText>
