    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Do the following: 1) Check the CXL and CPU system memory configuration and ensure that it complies
with the configurations in the Installation and Service Manual for your model. 2) Check for CXL or
MEM event messages that may indicate hardware issues and follow the recommended actions for
those messages.</diag:procedureText>
  </rdf:Description>
