    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Disable the Max Power Conservation Mode on the chassis and retry the operation. Using the Chassis Management Controller/Management Module (CMC/MM) web interface, select Chassis Overview&gt;Power&gt;Configuration and then uncheck the Max Power Conservation Mode field.</rdfs:comment>
