    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enable the CSIOR if disabled, reboot the host, complete the CSIOR operation and retry the operation. Refer the iDRAC/ LC Users Guide available on the support site for procedure to enable the CSIOR.</diag:itemText>
