    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-UEFI0410/procedure/01"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: To enable security, go to System Setup &gt; Processor Settings &gt; CPU Test Mode, and disable CPU Test Mode.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
