    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: PREPARATORY_OR_NAVIGATION. Setup/navigation or power isolation alone is not a cause-specific diagnosis or repair.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [1353, 1373); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove all power.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <diag:itemOrder rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger">4</diag:itemOrder>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</diag:nestingLevel>
  </rdf:Description>
