  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Smart-SSD-State-SSD-has-less-than-2-of-usage-remaining-before-wearout-5e35043973/procedure/01/cause">
