    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If that connectivity seems correct, reacknowledge the server.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [163, 226); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
