    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell SWC0073 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Update iDRAC firmware to the latest version and retry the operation. If the issue persists, Collect
