    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1710-Slot X Drive Array – Non-Array Controller Drives Detected Warning: possible data loss may occur. Physical drive(s) detected which had been previously attached to a non-array controller. Any non-array data on these drives will be lost unless they are removed. To save data, turn off system power immediately and remove the drives.</diag:messageText>
