    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">s:
•  Correct the specified profile settings to enable the iSCSI boot on a supported NIC.
•  Remove the iSCSI configuration from profile.
•  Insert a supported NIC card to configure iSCSI boot.</diag:procedureText>
