    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To recover from the error condition, reboot the server. Note: For single wired managed rack server, if the error happens on the single wired managed adapter, power cycle the server to recover from the error.</diag:itemText>
