    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">On the OpenManage Enterprise - Modular, select ForceActive (Devices-&gt; I/O Modules-&gt; Overview-&gt;
More Actions) to override the mismatch. The local configuration on the selected IOM will be applied to
both the SAS IOMs.</diag:procedureText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell SIOM0038 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
