  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-EPP001/procedure/01/item/001">
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that chassis has six EPP capable PSUs, Configure the Power Redundancy Policy to Grid Redundancy &amp; MPCM, DPSE, SBPM and Fresh Air features should be disabled. Then enable the EPP feature.</diag:itemText>
