    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: PREPARATORY_OR_NAVIGATION. Setup/navigation or power isolation alone is not a cause-specific diagnosis or repair.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Power down to remove the power completely from the server. Remove the system battery for 10 minutes.</diag:itemText>
