    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Management%20controller"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Restart the system by using the iDRAC Virtual Power Cycle feature or perform a manual Power Cycle operation on the system. To perform a manual Power Cycle operation, do the following: a) Disconnect the power cords. b) Wait 30 seconds. c) Reconnect the power cords.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
