    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [2, 145); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the issue is related to LOM or BOSS card associated with iDRAC, then update the LOM or BOSS card firmware using the latest Update Package.</diag:itemText>
