    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#PossibleCause"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 2003 possible cause 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">•  The primary OA IP, username, or password is not valid. This would include having insufficient
