    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the physical drive with a larger drive supported by the controller. To locate a supported option, review the product QuickSpecs on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</rdfs:comment>
