    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the PERC by using a PERC that has hard Secure Boot enabled. For information about replacing a PERC card, see the respective servers Installation and Service Manual available on the support site. Also, see the relevant QRL PowerEdge server micro videos.</rdfs:comment>
