    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Verify the Embedded System Management (ESM) Log for any sensor related faults. If there is a failed sensor, replace the system board.</rdfs:comment>
