    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: In order to use the Extended Power Performance (EPP) feature, replace the PSU identified in the message with a 3000 W PSU.</rdfs:comment>
