    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Chassis Management Controller (CMC) will retry turning on the server and the corresponding components associated to the server after a predefined interval. If the issue persists, refer to the Managing and Monitoring Power section in the CMC User Guide for more information on configuring power management settings.</diag:itemText>
