  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F2173/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">• Monitor the upgrade status in the FSM (Finite State Machine) tab of the affected SFP object in Cisco
UCS Manager.
• If the upgrade is stuck or fails, verify that the SFP module is a supported, Cisco-qualified transceiver.
• Ensure the appropriate firmware package is correctly uploaded to the Cisco UCS Manager catalog.
• If the fault persists, create a show tech-support file and contact Cisco TAC.</diag:procedureText>
    <diag:hasItem rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/CISCO-UCS-6-UCS-SEM-F2173/procedure/01/item/001"/>
