    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.  Remove the non-production DIMM.
For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard
Enterprise website.
2.  Install a supported DIMM.
For more information, see the server user guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website. To
locate a supported option, review the product QuickSpecs on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise
website.</diag:procedureText>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 296 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
