    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install the DIMMs in a supported configuration. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. To reseat the memory</diag:itemText>
