    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove, clean, inspect and reinstall the fan module at the earliest convenience. Refer to the Integrated Rack Controller Installation and Service Manual available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
