    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Smart SSD State: SSD has less than 5% of usage remaining before wearout. It has less than an estimated 56 days before it reaches the maximum usage limit and should be replaced as soon as possible.</diag:messageText>
