    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the mezzanine card that was recently added. For more information on removal and replacement procedures, see the Product Maintenance and Service Guide (http://www.hpe.com/info/ enterprise/docs).</diag:itemText>
