  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nc7a1f4040d864dcbb1446352e068847b">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Verify the PERC RAID controller battery installation for the associated bay.</rdfs:comment>
