    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 293); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ensure the security key is configured and available before accessing or reconfiguring the drive. It is recommended to not update the drive firmware when the drive is not in a locked state. For information about configuring security keys, see the PERC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
