    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check IML for other error messages. Back up any data stored on the persistent regions of the HPE Persistent Memory Module (PMM) immediately and replace the PMM.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
