    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the issue persists, enable some free storage space in the certificate store by deleting a few certificates, restart iDRAC, and then retry the operation.</rdfs:comment>
