  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Controller-State-The-array-controller-is-operating-without-a-memory-board-and-contains-more-lo-1863ac5999/procedure/01/item/001">
