    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the Allow CMC Updates Through OS and Lifecycle Controller setting is set to Enabled, and then retry the operation. Using the iDRAC Web UI, select iDRAC &gt; Update, click on the Settings tab, select Enabled for the setting and then click Apply button.</diag:itemText>
