    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Check the power consumption of the chassis. If the chassis is consuming significantly more power than configured in the power cap, consider reducing the group cap so that the power consumption of other chassis consumption can be reduced to make up for the increase.</diag:itemText>
