  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Ncee285c47b9e4601ab8b2f2786105e64">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: To enable this NVDIMM, either install previously used processor if the processor has been changed recently, or NVDIMM needs to be sanitized to configure it with the newly installed processor type. If manual data backup of NVDIMM is desired, try installing previously used processor to take manual data backup of NVDIMM. Chose desired system configuration afterward. Sanitizing DIMMs</rdfs:comment>
