    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Chassis Management Controller is unable to communicate with the iDRAC service processor for the Server identified in the message and the Server could not be turned off. This situation may occur when iDRAC is rebooting.</diag:explanation>
