  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Cache-module-The-cache-is-disabled-because-a-capacitor-has-failed-to-charge-to-an-acceptable-l-f8928e08f0">
