    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Re-seat the processor and update to the latest firmware. If the issue persists contact support
1.  Review any recent BIOS Firmware update or Customer Errata available related to this event
2.  Remove and re-insert the Processor installed on the socket specified in the IML description
3.  Replace the Processor</diag:procedureText>
