    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: PREPARATORY_OR_NAVIGATION. Setup/navigation or power isolation alone is not a cause-specific diagnosis or repair.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Log in to the management module web interface and verify the available power and blade standby power requirements. For more information about managing Power Supply Units (PSU), see the management module Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
