    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the NVDIMM. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle NVDIMMs can cause damage to NVDIMM components and the system board connector. See the Best Practices for Handling Memory Modules in ProLiant Server Configurations ( http://h20564.www2.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na-c00868283).</diag:itemText>
