    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Immediate attention is needed if the current mode of eRDHx is not intentionally set. In this mode, eRDHx is no longer cooling the rack. All systems in the rack must be in power off state. This mode is intended for maintenance purpose only.</diag:itemText>
