    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The CSIOR (Collect System Inventory on Restart) operation cannot be executed because the Lifecycle Controller (LC) firmware was not accessible. This issue is caused by missing LC partitions.</diag:causeText>
