    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The fault-tolerant pair of RAID controllers arg1 and arg2 can have issues in their PCIe fabric because both controllers are on the same PCIe fabric.</diag:causeText>
