    <diag:procedureLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Solution 2</diag:procedureLabel>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1.  Reboot the server.
2.  Run the diagnostics report and take appropriate action as indicated.
3.  If the issue persists, replace the controller.
4.  If the issue persists, contact Hewlett Packard Enterprise support.
For more information, see "Accessing Hewlett Packard Enterprise support."</diag:procedureText>
