    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Replace the indicated DIMM with a supported one as indicated in the memory population guidelines. Review documentation for more information on supported configurations.</rdfs:comment>
