    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Repair Lifecycle Controller firmware using the Lifecycle Controller Dell Update Package (DUP) or
Lifecycle Controller Repair Package via iDRAC. For more information, see Lifecycle Controller Users
Guide.</diag:procedureText>
