    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Update the Power Supply Unit (PSU) firmware after making sure that the System Board PSU Redundancy is already set to "Full Redundant" by running the following RACADM command: "racadm getsensorinfo". If already in this mode, check to ensure that both the PSUs are operational.</rdfs:comment>
