    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 489); ACTIONABLE_SOURCE_PREFIX; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the identified DIMM with a DIMM that supports ECC. To verify if the memory is either under warranty or contract go to the Customer Self Repair website. This enables Hewlett Packard Enterprise to ship replacement parts directly to you once a failure has been confirmed. For specific information about customer replaceable parts, refer to the product maintenance and service guide. Create a Hewlett Packard Enterprise support case If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
