    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 262); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Attempt to download the enclosure firmware again. If problems continue, verify that the controller can communicate with the enclosure. Make sure that the enclosure is powered ON. Refer to the storage hardware documentation for information on checking the cables.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
