    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#PossibleCause"/>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">•  The energy pack was not sufficiently charged to provide backup power for the cache module.
•  The data could not be copied to the Write-Back Cache.
