    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#RecoveryProcedure"/>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Import the file by using the BIOS System Setup page by pressing F2 when the company logo is
