    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell PWR2283 recommendation 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Do one of the following and retry the operation: 1) Wait few seconds and retry. 2) Reset iDRAC. 3)
