  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-UEFI0046/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Do one of the following: 1) Update the BIOS firmware. 2) Go to System Setup &gt; System Security
page, click the "Clear" option under TPM command. Restart the system. For TPM 1.2, go to System
Setup &gt; System Security page, click the "Activate" option under TPM command, and then enable TXT.</diag:procedureText>
