  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/DELL-EEM-2026-EEM-CTL45/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the Dual In-line Memory Module (DIMM) to avoid data loss or data corruption. The DIMM is a
part of the controller battery pack. Refer to hardware documentation for information on replacing the
DIMM.</diag:procedureText>
