    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Retry the operation. If the problem persists, do one the following: 1) Check if there are other
operations running on the iDRAC and wait for the operations to complete, and retry the operation.
2) Restart the server, and retry the operation.</diag:procedureText>
