    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the host IP address is valid and retry the operation. Click System Setup &gt; Network Settings &gt; NVME-oF Device Settings, and then edit the host IP address, if necessary.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 182); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
