  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-OA-Syslog-Redundancy-log-messages-Redundancy-Onboard-Administrator-redundancy-failed-to-initialize-pr-operly-T-c8cef0c880/procedure/01/item/001">
