    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">•  The server ambient temperature is too high.
•  The fans solution is not adequate for the server configuration.
•  The energy pack is faulty.</diag:causeText>
