    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the backup file is available, restore the startup configuration data manually by running the following command at the CLI: "copy scp://admin:admin@hostip/&lt;SERVICETAG&gt;.xml config://startup.xml".</diag:itemText>
