    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Verify that no ventilation issues exist and that the airflow path is not blocked. If the server is operated for an extended period with the access panel removed, airflow might be impeded, damaging thermal components.</diag:itemText>
