    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/component-type/Cooling%20device"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Retry the diagnostics; if the problem persists, the fan is faulty. Make sure that the BIOS is current and retry the diagnostics.</rdfs:comment>
