    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the CPU4001 message is reported after CPU4003, map the address reported in CPU4001 to a system component. Update the component driver and firmware. Else, no response action is required.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
