    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Ensure the security key is configured and available before accessing or reconfiguring the drive. It
is recommended to not update the drive firmware when the drive is not in a locked state. For
information about configuring security keys, see the PERC Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:procedureText>
