    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install the new DIMM. CAUTION: Failure to properly handle DIMMs can cause damage to DIMM components and the system board connector. See the DIMM handling guidelines on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise Library at: http://www.hpe.com/info/enterprise/docs</diag:itemText>
