  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N5063b6f99da44d52a827b8d98f3b304e">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Enable NVDIMM-N Memory Interleaving, and then reboot the server. If all the other NVDIMMs in the interleaved set are still installed, the data on the NVDIMM will be available after rebooting. If any of the other NVDIMMs in the interleaved set are missing, a different error message might occur. For more information, see the HPE 16GB NVDIMM User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website (https://www.hpe.com/info/NVDIMM-docs).</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-377/procedure/01"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-377/procedure/01/item/001"/>
