    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure that the XML file schema used for chassis configuration is compliant with the schema defined in the Lifecycle Controller XML Schema Guide on the Tech Center support site.</rdfs:comment>
