    <diag:eventName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">fltEquipmentChassisInaccessibleB</diag:eventName>
    <diag:eventCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">F1793</diag:eventCode>
    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This fault typically occurs because a Shared I/O module has lost its connection to B side FI. This is a major fault because it can result in the loss of network connectivity and disrupt data traffic on B side.</diag:explanation>
