    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove the Dual Inline Memory Modules (DIMMs) and install in a supported, symmetric configuration between the Integrated Memory Controllers (iMCs). For more information, see the platform Owners Manual available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
