    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Hardware P State (HWP) mode cannot be enabled because the processor does not support the HWP mode. The CPU Power Management setting has changed to System DBPM (DAPC).</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
