  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Physical-Drive-State-Single-ported-drives-are-not-supported-for-configuration-and-should-be-di-210112e744/procedure/01/cause">
