  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N694b24fbd3704d9e9d1fa3065ac2a4d9">
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0032-0x0233/procedure/01"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Re-seat the DIMMs in the identified channel and update the System ROM. Inspect DIMM sockets and the system board for bent pins or damaged traces. Perform the following procedure for each affected DIMM.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
