    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove or replace the connector daughter board and external cables connected to the Smart Array Controller board. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</rdfs:comment>
