    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The HTTP Boot certificate cannot be exported for the BIOS boot device because one or more of the following reasons: 1) Insufficient space in the destination folder. 2) The certificate file is not available. 3) Destination folder cannot be accessed. Insufficient access rights. 5) Unknown internal issues.</diag:causeText>
