    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Install a supported power supply unit (PSU). For information about supported PSUs, see the product
documentation available on the support site.If it is a supported PSU in this configuration, reseat the
PSU.</diag:procedureText>
