    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x0007 printed item 4</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: PREPARATORY_OR_NAVIGATION. Setup/navigation or power isolation alone is not a cause-specific diagnosis or repair.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [498, 734); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
