    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The TRAIN definitions share the DIMM operability message templates and concern DIMM error/degradation conditions. F0184 is degraded and F0185 is inoperable: similarity preserves this distinction and does not make their recommendations interchangeable.</rdfs:comment>
