    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Specify a physical disk with a larger capacity or replace the specified physical disk with one with more capacity, and then retry the operation.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
