    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Witness Server processor temperature increased beyond the threshold value. The Processor thermal protection triggered the CPU throttle action. Factors external to the processor may have induced this issue.</diag:explanation>
