    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: CONTEXT_OR_REFERENCE. No recognised diagnostic/corrective instruction in this printed item.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Correctly connect the cables to the storage system. For more information, see the product user guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
