    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The firmware on the EMM modules is not the same version. It is required that both modules have the same version of the firmware. This alert may be caused when you attempt to insert an EMM module that has a different firmware version than an existing module.</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
