    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Update the LOM firmware to the latest Update Package. For information about updating the LOM firmware, see the iDRAC Users Guide available on the Dell support site. If the issue persists, restart iDRAC and retry the operation.</diag:itemText>
