    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#PossibleCause"/>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The iDRAC controller cannot communicate with the power management firmware due to an problem with the interface to the power management engine or with the power management engine itself. The system may operate in a performance degraded state.</diag:causeText>
