    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Devices PSU is already occupied by PDU outlet, Clear the existing assignment using REST API /api/ PowerService/PowerDevices/Actions/PowerDevices.DissociateDevices and retry the operation.</rdfs:comment>
