    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">1779-Slot X Drive Array – Logical drive(s) previously failed. Select "F1" to continue with logical drives disabled Select "F2" to accept data loss and to re-enable logical drives (Followed by one of the following:) • Logical drive(s) disabled due to possible data loss. • Logical drive(s) reenabled. Restore data from backup if replacement drive(s) have been installed.</diag:messageText>
