  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N96cac7ac6a5a4781a498e52a29ae7d4b">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">population-assessment-1.0; automatic source-anchored rule assessment, not expert validation. Shared concepts: Processor. The target retains the complete documented possible-cause block; alternatives are not asserted as confirmed causes.</rdfs:comment>
