    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Determine which drive is defective using HPE SSA. Then, replace the defective cables, drive, or both. Depending on the fault-tolerance level, all data might be lost if another drive fails. For more information, see the HPE Smart Storage Administrator User Guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website. For removal and replacement procedures, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:itemText>
  </rdf:Description>
