  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Cache-module-The-cache-for-this-controller-is-temporarily-disabled-since-a-snapshot-is-in-prog-5387f3ab3b/message/01">
    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cache module: The cache for this controller is temporarily disabled since a snapshot is in progress. The controller requires a reboot to enable the cache. Until the reboot occurs, cache module operations such as Expansion, Extension, and Migration are disabled.</diag:messageText>
