    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the failed physical disk. Identify the failed physical disk by locating the disk that has a red "X" for its status. Rebuild the physical disk. When finished, restart the virtual disk format operation.</diag:itemText>
