    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Optional. If the controller is a PCI card, verify the controller backup power cable is installed properly. For additional information, see the system Maintenance and Service Guide at http://www.hpe.com/ info/enterprise/docs.</rdfs:comment>
