    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Restart the server using the minimum processor configuration. If the boot operation is successful then restore the server configuration but one component at a time. If unsuccessful, replace the component indicated in the message. For more information about the steps to recover from this issue, see the Field Service Manual (FSM).</rdfs:comment>
