    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remove and re-install the fan or replace the fan, and open the OMSA Web interface to verify if the fan specified in the message is displayed correctly. If the issue persists, contact your service provider.</diag:itemText>
