    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">If the fault reports a "Missing or Faulty Fan" error, check on the status of that fan. If it needs replacement, create a show tech-support file for the chassis and contact Cisco TAC.</diag:itemText>
