    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Check PCIe node is properly seated, both XFMs are installed properly and the proper PCIe XFABRIC MEZZ (TwinPeak B0 or PikesPeak) is being used.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
