    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure all cables are properly connected. For information about cabling, see the Owners Manual available at the support site.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
