    <diag:explanation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An error has triggered a Downstream Port Containment event in the SSD bay and slot identified in the message. The Operating System is automatically notified about this to make an attempt to recover from the issue.</diag:explanation>
