    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Review the Embedded System Management (ESM) Log for memory exceptions. Re-install the memory modules at the identified location .</rdfs:comment>
