  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x0027-0x0003/procedure/01/item/004">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [489, 707); FULL_TEXT_SOURCE_MARKERS; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: ESCALATION_OR_SUPPORT. Warranty/support administration is not a cause-specific diagnosis or corrective operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:sourceLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3.</diag:sourceLabel>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Increase the configured power cap value. If additional hardware has been added to the server, power calibration during the next server boot may resolve this issue. If this issue persists, create an HPE Support Case.</diag:itemText>
    <diag:nestingLevel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</diag:nestingLevel>
