    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Interlock_mon.c (vrd\src): { ICT_FAULT_KEY(ICT_MISCELLANEOUS, 2, 0), EVT_CRITICAL , EVT_CLASS_INTERLOCK, EVT_IL_DEV_INSTALLED_STATE }, Recommended Action: replace IOM. This is not a customer serviceable part, so if the LOM isn’t installed the IOM is not assembled correctly. The ETH ports on the IOM won’t work.</diag:itemText>
