    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A diagnostic warning event occurred on the Software Defined Persistent Memory (SDPM) virtual DIMM located at arg1. Check the device and system configuration. Extended ID: arg2.</diag:messageText>
