    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FCPU error is detected for adapter [id] in server [id].FCPU error is detected for adapter [id] in server [chassisId]/[slotId].FCPU error is detected for adapter [id] in server [chassisId]/[slotId]/[serverInstanceId].</diag:messageText>
