    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: If the SEL is enabled, review the SEL statistics on the DIMM to determine which threshold was crossed.</rdfs:comment>
