    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dell SIOM0068 printed item 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the firmware version of SAS IOM components are consistent and retry the operation. For information about managing SAS IOM devices, refer to OpenManage Enterprise Modular Version Users Guide available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
