    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 219); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Purpose assessment: SOURCE_ANCHORED_RULE_LINK. Explicit action verb and shared documented component/condition in the same source group; inferred intended purpose only.</rdfs:comment>
    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Make sure that the SAS cables are firmly attached to the enclosure or backplane. For information about using SAS cables, see the respective PowerEdge server Installation and Service Manual available on the support site.</diag:itemText>
