    <diag:itemText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Power off the server and ensure that the sensor cable is properly connected to the zone identified in the message. If the issue persists then provide this iDRAC Lifecycle log to the Technical Support team.</diag:itemText>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Source action_text character span [0, 205); UNNUMBERED_SOURCE_BLOCK; order is printed/text order, not an execution dependency.</rdfs:comment>
