    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">HPE 0x3119 possible cause 1</rdfs:label>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An HPE Persistent Memory Module is reporting that there is only %4 percent or less of its specified life
