    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Verify the DIMM map-out configuration in system BIOS setup and make sure that at least one DIMM is physically present in the server and enabled. For information about DIMM installation, see the respective Installation and Service Manual of the server.</rdfs:comment>
