  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Na328ab2db91f41e2ae8f84df36b06f83">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: To enable this NVDIMM, either Channel Interleaving need to be set as Disabled or all NVDIMMs on identified processor must be sanitized to work with present system configuration. If manual data backup of NVDIMM is desired, set system configuration as Channel Interleaving disabled to match with NVDIMM configuration and take NVDIMM data backup. Chose desired system configuration afterwards. Enabling or disabling Channel Interleaving</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-IML-2026-IML-Class-0x000A-0x0385/procedure/01/item/002"/>
