  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Physical-Drive-State-SATA-drives-are-not-supported-for-configuration-and-should-be-disconnecte-1ef910d5f3/procedure/01">
    <diag:procedureText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Replace the physical drive with a drive supported by the controller. To locate a supported option, review
the product QuickSpecs on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</diag:procedureText>
