    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The BIOS configuration data cannot be retrieved either because the system inventory is not collected, Lifecycle Controller Wipe operation is performed, or because of a system error.</diag:causeText>
