    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove all DIMMs. For more information, see the server maintenance and service guide on the Hewlett Packard Enterprise website.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-POST-271/procedure/01"/>
    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#targetsComponentType"/>
