  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting/data/event/HPE-GEN9-V2-Troubleshooting-Redundant-Path-Failure-The-logical-drive-is-degraded-due-to-the-loss-of-a-redundant-path-e88916c063/procedure/01/cause">
