    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Remove Processor %1 DIMM %2 or DIMM %3 per the memory population guidelines. For DIMM population, see the Population rules for HPE DDR4 memory with HPE ProLiant and Synergy Gen10 servers (http://www.hpe.com/docs/memory-population-rules)</rdfs:comment>
