    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://example.org/server-troubleshooting#PossibleCause"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data in the write cache was lost due to one of the following:
•  Unprotected write back enabled without an energy pack present
•  One more cables were loose.
•  The energy pack has failed.
•  The Controller Firmware is outdated
•  SSD Caching Enabled and cache volume failed.</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
