    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Automatic source-text assessment: explicit diagnostic/corrective verb and component mention in the instruction. This is a procedure target, not necessarily the component responsible for the event. Evidence: Make sure that the slot number of the MX7116n Fabric Expander Module and the slot number of the Network IOM are the same like (A or B) [1]----(A or B) [1] and (A or B) [2]----(A or B) [2]. Mezz cards can be different either A or B but slot number should be same.</rdfs:comment>
