    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3DS LRDIMMs are not supported on the processor when an Intel Optane PMem for HPE Module is present
on the same processor and configured with a mix of volatile and persistent regions.</diag:causeText>
