    <diag:messageText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">377-NVDIMM Error – Processor X, DIMM Y. NVDIMM set for interleaving enabled but system configured for interleaving disabled. NVDIMM has been disabled.</diag:messageText>
  </rdf:Description>
