    <diag:causeText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The fan speed cannot be controlled because a sled mismatch or hardware incompatibility is detected. This results in fans rotating at the maximum allowed speed (RPM).</diag:causeText>
  </rdf:Description>
